/* --- drive minigame dialogue (added) --- */
Object.assign(window._translations['zh'], {"Cliveman: \"Dudley at night. Charming as a tax audit.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"夜里的达德利。迷人得像一场税务审计。\"","Cliveman: \"Big Smiles Mayo Corp. Can't miss a building that big... apparently I can.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"大笑蛋黄酱公司。这么大的楼不可能错过……看来我可以。\"","Cliveman: \"Every street in this town looks the same.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"这镇上每条街看起来都一样。\"","Cliveman: \"Red marker, red marker... where IS the red marker.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"红色标记，红色标记……红色标记到底在哪。\"","Cliveman: \"This thing handles like a sofa with opinions.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"这玩意儿开起来像一张有主见的沙发。\"","Cliveman: \"I should have taken the bus.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"我真该坐公交车的。\"","*the engine growls low*":"*引擎低沉地咆哮*","*tires hum over wet asphalt*":"*轮胎在湿沥青上嗡嗡作响*","*the V8 rumbles*":"*V8 发动机隆隆作响*","Cliveman: \"*CRUNCH* ...I meant to do that.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"*咔嚓* ……我是故意的。\"","Cliveman: \"That wall came out of nowhere.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"那堵墙不知从哪冒出来的。\"","Cliveman: \"The city can bill me.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"让市政府给我寄账单吧。\"","Cliveman: \"Parked. Aggressively.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"停好了。很有攻击性地停好了。\"","*tires screech against brick*":"*轮胎刮蹭砖墙发出尖响*","*metal crunch echoes down the block*":"*金属撞击声在街区回荡*","Bevan: \"Pete's Subs... oh man, I can already taste the meatball.\"":"贝文：\"皮特三明治店……天哪，我已经尝到肉丸的味道了。\"","Cliveman: \"You can taste it because you haven't had a real meal in days, Bevan.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"你尝到是因为你好几天没好好吃饭了，贝文。\"","Bevan: \"Are we there yet, Clive?\"":"贝文：\"到了吗，克莱夫？\"","Cliveman: \"We were almost there until you grabbed the wheel.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"本来快到了，直到你来抢方向盘。\"","Bevan: \"I think I left my bottle back in Dudley.\"":"贝文：\"我好像把酒瓶落在达德利了。\"","Cliveman: \"Good. Consider it a head start on sobriety.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"很好。就当是戒酒的一个良好开端。\"","Bevan: \"Clive, if you hit one pothole my stomach is staging a coup.\"":"贝文：\"克莱夫，你要是压到一个坑，我的胃就要发动政变了。\"","Cliveman: \"Then hold it together. We're close.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"那就给我撑住。快到了。\"","Bevan: \"*hic* ...do subs come with a side of nap?\"":"贝文：\"*嗝* ……三明治配的是午觉吗？\"","Bevan: \"I miss Karen. Karen would've loved a meatball sub.\"":"贝文：\"我想凯伦了。凯伦肯定会爱死肉丸三明治的。\"","*Bevan hums something tuneless*":"*贝文跑调地哼着什么*","Bevan: \"WHOA-HO! Watch the road, watch the ROAD!\"":"贝文：\"哇哦——！看路，看路啊！\"","Cliveman: \"I AM watching the road, Bevan.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"我正在看路，贝文。\"","Bevan: \"My sub's gonna be a SQUISHED sub before we even buy it!\"":"贝文：\"还没买，我的三明治就要变成压扁的三明治了！\"","Cliveman: \"*CRUNCH* ...the city can bill me.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"*咔嚓* ……让市政府给我寄账单吧。\"","Bevan: \"You drive worse than I do, and I can't feel my face!\"":"贝文：\"你开得比我还烂，而我连脸都没知觉了！\"","Cliveman: \"That is not the endorsement you think it is.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"这可不是你以为的那种夸奖。\"","*metal crunch, and a drunken WOO from the passenger seat*":"*金属撞击声，副驾驶座传来醉醺醺的'喔——'*","*Bevan slides into the door with a thud*":"*贝文砰地撞到车门上*","Cliveman: \"There it is. Big Smiles Mayo Corp HQ.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"就在那儿。大笑蛋黄酱公司总部。\"","\"You can't do that now.\"":"\"你现在不能那么做。\"","\"The Buick coughs to life. You and Bevan climb in. Bevan immediately reclines the seat and groans.\"":"\"别克咳嗽着发动起来。你和贝文上了车。贝文立刻把座椅放倒，哼哼起来。\"","Cliveman: \"Pete's Subs. Try not to fall out of the car, Bevan.\"":"克莱夫曼：\"皮特三明治店。尽量别从车里掉出去，贝文。\""});

/* --- drive intro / objective lines (added) --- */
Object.assign(window._translations['zh'], {">>>>>   NIGHT DRIVE   <<<<<":">>>>>   夜间驾驶   <<<<<","  Find BIG SMILES MAYO CORP HQ - follow the GREEN ARROW to the glowing RED marker.":"  找到大笑蛋黄酱公司总部 - 跟随绿色箭头前往发光的红色标记。","  Find PETE'S SUBS - follow the GREEN ARROW to the glowing RED marker.":"  找到皮特三明治店 - 跟随绿色箭头前往发光的红色标记。"});
